===Noun===
{{en-noun|spacemen}}

# {{lb|en|informal|childish}} An [[astronaut]], often a male astronaut.
#: {{ux|en|I want to be a '''spaceman''' when I grow up.}}
# {{lb|en|informal}} A [[humanoid]] [[extraterrestrial]].
#* {{quote-book|en|url=https://archive.org/details/1000storiesillus0000proc/page/10/mode/2up?q=%22spaceman+from+mars%22|title=1000 stories and illustrations for all occasions|author=Prochnow, Herbert V. (Herbert Victor), 1897-1998|oclc=1037358658|year=1972|text=A '''spaceman''' from Mars could easily pick out the most civilized nations here. They are the only ones who know how to make atom bombs.}}
#* {{quote-book|en|url=https://archive.org/details/strangestoriesof0000ortz/page/142/mode/2up?q=%22spaceman+from+saturn%22|title=Strange stories of UFOs|author=Ortzen, Len|oclc=761284893|year=1977|text=While in Los Angeles he was contacted by a '''spaceman''' from Saturn whose name was Ramu{{...}}}}
#* {{quote-book|en|url=https://archive.org/details/paranormal0000wolf/page/168/mode/2up?q=%22spaceman+from+venus%22|title=Paranormal|author=Wolfsblume, Jack|oclc=1245645437|year=2011|text=He was out UFO-hunting in the Mojave Desert, California, when he was greeted by a tall, blond '''spaceman''' from Venus}}

